      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside the Ikezawa family kitchen on his day off, daughter Taeko and wife Yurie tease Ikezawa about bringing work home. Once he finishes plating his homemade dish, the mood melts into warm family excitement around the table. Listen to the relaxed home conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "taeko",
      "t": "今日お休みでしょう？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "すまん、すまん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "yurie",
      "t": "トラブルですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "取引先とのちょっとしたすれ違いだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "taeko",
      "t": "せっかく家族団らんの時間なのに。",
      "gap": 0.55
