    },
    {
      "v": "yurie",
      "t": "トラブルですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is there trouble?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "取引先とのちょっとしたすれ違いだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just a small misunderstanding with a business partner.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeko",
      "t": "せっかく家族団らんの時間なのに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even though it is finally our family time together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeko",
      "t": "子供扱いしないで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not treat me like a child.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よし、完璧だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, it is perfect.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeko",
      "t": "うわあ、おいしそう！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wow, that looks delicious!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeko",
      "t": "いい香り。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a nice aroma.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "yurie",
      "t": "おなかすいた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am hungry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
